## Sunday 21st June 2026

### Objective

Today’s aim was to batch the fixed steps of the preprocessing pipeline and run those batched pre-QC steps on the first 10 healthy controls.

### Work completed

A reusable fixed pre-QC script was used to process the first 10 healthy controls through:

* continuous conversion
* trial definition
* epoched conversion
* baseline correction
* downsampling
* high-pass filtering
* low-pass filtering

Each participant produced a final filtered pre-QC output file.

