### Summary of first-pass batching outcome

The fixed pre-QC batching stage was completed successfully for 10 healthy controls. All 10 participants were processed through the standardised pre-QC steps and produced final filtered pre-QC datasets.

Trial counts varied across participants:

* 3 participants had exactly **1500 trials**
* 1 participant had **1501 trials**
* several participants had lower trial counts in the **1247-1333** range

A subset of participants showed out-of-bounds warnings during epoched conversion, suggesting that one or more final epochs could not be fully read at the end of the recording.

